1
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:39,840
Give it to me.

2
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:43,960
What are you trying to do, Mala?

3
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:45,200
Are you going to hurt yourself?

4
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,000
You have such a good life.

5
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:46,720
You have everything.

6
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:47,640
Why are you giving up?

7
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:49,570
Just because of that little thing?

8
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:50,759
You're crazy.

9
00:01:50,759 --> 00:01:52,220
I don't need those things.

10
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:55,900
I don't need those things.

11
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:56,840
Zhiwei.

12
00:01:57,880 --> 00:01:58,940
Do you understand?

13
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:00,520
I don't need these things.

14
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:01,680
Can you understand?

15
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,160
Cut the crap.

16
00:02:05,160 --> 00:02:05,840
Let's go.

17
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:12,850
I can't do this anymore.

18
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:13,960
I can't fight anymore.

19
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:14,520
Get up.

20
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,260
No resting until the training time is up.

21
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,360
Remember this.

22
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,420
A wolf hunting in the wild,

23
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:23,680
once it loses its target,

24
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:25,320
will have its food snatched by others

25
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,120
until it starves to death.

26
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,040
Do you understand?

27
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:27,760
Get up.

28
00:02:30,079 --> 00:02:31,160
Am I your child?

29
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:33,320
Do you not like me at all?

30
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,360
Do you love me?

31
00:02:35,079 --> 00:02:36,880
Don't you know if I love you or not?

32
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:38,480
You're just spoiled by your mom.

33
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:40,440
As a boy, don't be so whiny.

34
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:43,320
How do you think you got the life you have now?

35
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:44,850
Was it given to you for free?

36
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:48,440
I hunted for it outside like a hungry wolf.

37
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:53,280
If you don't have the ambition to overcome difficulties and climb up,

38
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,240
how will you survive in this world?

39
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:56,840
Do you

40
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,400
want to be like the losers out there,

41
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,530
accomplishing nothing in this world?

42
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:03,720
I'm doing this for your own good.

43
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,480
I've been through it.

44
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:17,160
Nonsense.

45
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:19,480
He is my son.

46
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:21,140
How could I possibly hurt him?

47
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:25,040
I have spent ten years

48
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:27,280
making those who bullied him

49
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,920
pay the price they deserve.

50
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,280
Haven't I done enough?

51
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:35,400
You'd better tell me honestly

52
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:37,640
what you did to him.

53
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:40,360
Speak!

54
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:52,920
Here, this is for you.

55
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,840
What is this?

56
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:07,240
A meteorite.

57
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:10,810
My mom gave it to me before she died.

58
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,080
Such an important thing,

59
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:15,340
and you're giving it to me?

60
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:19,660
This isn't the first time I've seen you smile like that.

61
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:22,520
I remember once,

62
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:26,100
I happened to travel back here

63
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:29,920
and saw the two of us just sitting like this.

64
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:35,460
There was an evening breeze that day,

65
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,560
and the sea.

66
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:43,240
And then I felt so happy.

67
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:45,800
Because from that moment on,

68
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,480
I had a friend too.

69
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,080
Since then,

70
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:53,880
I've come here countless times.

71
00:04:56,440 --> 00:04:57,770
From different angles,

72
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:02,360
watching our conversation today over and over again.

73
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,280
You don't know

74
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:10,100
how much I wish time could stop here forever.

75
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:17,520
It's just...

76
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,520
I'm sorry.

77
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:25,000
I didn't know until today

78
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:28,400
that our conversation happened like this.

79
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:31,560
Thank you.

80
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,400
There is no one left in this world

81
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:42,680
who loves me.

82
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,159
Only you

83
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:50,320
are my...

84
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:51,800
Buddy.

85
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:55,840
When I was very young,

86
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,600
I understood a truth.

87
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:03,720
In this world, you can talk about winning and losing,

88
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,880
about money,

89
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:08,500
and even hatred can resonate.

90
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:11,760
Only love,

91
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,380
no one truly understands.

92
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,920
What did you do to him?

93
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:31,800
I did to him...

94
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:36,400
I did...

95
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:41,659
the thing I regret most in my entire life.

96
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:04,920
Do you remember that cursed nursery rhyme?

97
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,380
I've always been curious.

98
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,600
If you met another version of yourself in time and space,

99
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,800
what would happen?

100
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:17,640
What are you trying to do?

101
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:18,520
I'm too tired.

102
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,080
I want to take a rest.

103
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:33,080
And see what exactly is

104
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,600
on the other end of the rules.

105
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,580
Where are you going, Mala?

106
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,850
Where are you going?

107
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,320
Mala!

108
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,400
Mala, come back!

109
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:41,760
Mala!
